  "dcterms:title": "Knowledge graph L3: Actor Definition",
  "dcterms:description": "A FHIR ActorDefinition -- an L2 persona made a FHIR resource. ZERO in the immunizations IG and 22 in smart-base, which is itself worth a coverage query. The SOP names no profile for it and says one is not currently possible because SUSHI cannot profile an R5 resource in an R4 IG, and it tells authors not to assign an identifier -- so expect a bare resource and do not infer more. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/actor-definition.",
